# 17. SCREEN STATUS CLASSIFICATION

Each screen receives exactly one primary status:

```text
NOT_FOUND
SHELL_ONLY
STATIC
PARTIAL
FUNCTIONAL
INTEGRATED
VERIFIED
CONFLICT
```

Definitions:

### NOT_FOUND

No implementation exists.

### SHELL_ONLY

Route/layout exists but meaningful screen functionality does not.

### STATIC

Visual implementation exists but behavior is largely mocked/static.

### PARTIAL

Some functional behavior exists.

### FUNCTIONAL

Core screen behavior exists.

### INTEGRATED

Connected to the required system dependencies.

### VERIFIED

Implementation has evidence demonstrating compliance.

### CONFLICT

Implementation contradicts the approved specification.

