# 46. GAP SEVERITY

Use:

## CRITICAL

Blocks safe or correct implementation.

Examples:

```text
security architecture conflict
state integrity problem
fundamental domain contradiction
critical authorization gap
destructive implementation conflict
```

## HIGH

Blocks a major implementation capability.

## MEDIUM

Requires correction but does not block immediate foundational work.

## LOW

Quality improvement or cleanup.

